# Manual Depot Cache config, mimicking the customer (T-9105).
# The auth header is injected on the COMMAND LINE (like their bazelisk
# wrapper), NOT here, so that under auto-connect Depot's injected per-runner
# header (from ~/.bazelrc) sorts ahead of ours. Only remote_cache and the
# repo-contents cache live in the rc, matching the customer's setup.
build --remote_cache=grpcs://cache.depot.dev
startup --experimental_remote_repo_contents_cache
